{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06UH", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6dd0f5ddabe64973e34fef899c3060607b18ec68b3b86fd44719802239ff5205", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIf the stack is quasi-DM then residual gerbes exist too.\nIn particular, residual gerbes always exist for Deligne-Mumford stacks.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b0ec6ace4b094e6aac45bc194d985f64edc300f4f55f5a39415d54b7d5cc2e0f", "unit_id": "tag:06UH:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06UH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$x$", "MATH_0004": "$x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-every-point-residual-gerbe-quasi-DM}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f7d8a0152e8f991d2d98e80e4b0ce54ef390bbdc402cc3fbea7b6d3723db0b15", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8c80b462e216acd02f2b41ee92aa22394b1b1d146a4af0861bcf9113be2abb89", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-DM algebraic stack.\nThen the residual gerbe of <MATH_0002> at <MATH_0003> exists for\nevery <MATH_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d78dc6c288a26108cba8dfc4eb49dde7b1665016112ea7b2790a2d01df424ab7", "unit_id": "tag:06UI:statement"}
